The link said "Stack Overflow, the preeminent site for programmers" not Sta=
ck Exchange. Stack Overflow is just one sub-network of Stack Exchange.


See the current Stack Exchange sites here: http://stackexchange.com/sites

They have Latin, sports, religions, mythology and many natural languages as=
 sub-networks, so Lojban would be a good candidate to fit in with all their=
 other languages.


